Fri Sep 18 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - rodrigo@lyraos.com.br

- Initial package of Lyra Downloads 0.1.0:
  * GTK4/libadwaita download manager using a private aria2 instance
    controlled over JSON-RPC (loopback, random secret).
  * Per-download connection profiles (1, 4, 8, 16), persistent queue,
    pause/resume/cancel/retry/reorder, recovery after restart.
  * Optional SHA-256 verification with explicit match/mismatch states.
  * Single-instance background service reachable over a user-only Unix
    socket; closing the window does not stop downloads.
  * firefox-integration subpackage: native messaging host and global
    Firefox registration (the extension itself is distributed separately).
